  "body": "A solid brick classic with an outdoor bonus, this charming two-bedroom home offers generously sized exclusive-use land to make the most of summer.\r\n\r\nTongue-and-groove timber floors bring warmth and character, complemented by soft neutral interiors and a lovely beamed ceiling throughout the living space. The doors open out wide to the deck, bringing the indoor and outdoor living areas together into one generous space for entertaining and relaxing. Established greenery provides a lovely backdrop for morning coffee and summer barbecues.\r\n\r\nBeyond the deck, there's room to potter, plant and enjoy your own outdoor space. A half share of the carport adds everyday convenience.\r\n\r\nMurrays Bay's wonderful coastal community adds to the appeal, along with Rangitoto College zoning and primary and intermediate schooling just up the hill.\r\n\r\nWhether you're buying your first home or looking to downsize without giving up the garden, this is one to experience for yourself.\r\n\r\n\r\nTo view and download property files, please follow this link: https://www.harcourtsfiles.co.nz/listings/RKE6",
